    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Weight 147 lb. Not cutting during Block 4, just fueling.</div><div><br/></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>day type</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>kcal</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>protein</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>carbs</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>fat</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">hard / long day</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">3,000</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">160 g</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">410 g</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">80 g</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">easy day</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">2,700</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">160 g</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">340 g</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">80 g</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">rest / travel</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">2,400</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">150 g</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">270 g</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">80 g</td></tr></table><div><br/></div><ul><li>Protein ~1.1 g/lb, spread 4 x 40 g.</li><li>Long runs &gt; 90': 1 gel every 35-40'. practice the race gels (the caffeinated one at 60').</li><li>Before threshold sessions: oats + banana 2 h before.</li><li>Incubator kitchen is shared — prep Sunday, label everything.</li></ul></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
